COMPLIANCE:
Scene ID: SC_004_005
Allowed events: The party infiltrates the restricted Maintenance Trenches, defeating a low-level security construct to follow the data conduit.
Forbidden milestones: custom_liability_contract_signed = DONE, vermin_control_completed = DONE
