- Vance Harrow holds Rebar in hand_right.
- Rhea Mercer holds Makeshift Masonry Bludgeon in hand_right.
- Rhea Mercer stows Scrap Parchment and Charcoal Stick in blazer_pocket_right.

APPEARANCE_CHECK:
- rhea_mercer: No appearance changes.
